{"tail":"Blessed art Thou, O Lord our God, King of the World, who has chosen worthy prophets and found pleasure in their words that are spoken in truth. Blessed art Thou, O Lord, who has chosen the Torah and His servant Moses, His people Israel and prophets of truth and righteousness. "}
